#: kcmkded.cpp:76
msgid "Startup Services"
msgstr "Startup servisi"

#: kcmkded.cpp:77
msgid ""
"This shows all KDE services that can be loaded on KDE startup. Checked "
"services will be invoked on next startup. Be careful with deactivation of "
"unknown services."
msgstr ""
"Ovo pokazuje sve KDE servise koji mogu biti pokrenuti pri pokretanju KDEa. "
"Izabrani servisi će biti pokrenuti pri slijedećem startup-u. Budite "
"pažljivi kod deaktivacije nepoznatih servisa."

